@owner: mason
@stability: stable
@since: 2026-06-09
@reviewed: 2026-06-09

Feature: Output Mode Flags
  "Derives human vs JSON output behavior from global CLI flags."

  Provides:
    - output.Options @source("symbol:Options")
    - output.Options.DetailAllowed @source("symbol:DetailAllowed")
    - output.Options.DebugAllowed @source("symbol:DebugAllowed")

  Invariants:
    - Quiet MUST suppress normal human detail
    - Verbose detail MUST NOT appear when Quiet is set

  Scenario (happy-path): Normal output
    Given default Options
    When DetailAllowed is checked
    Then it returns true

  Scenario (happy-path): Quiet mode
    Given Options with Quiet true
    When DetailAllowed and DebugAllowed are checked
    Then both return false
